  m_Name: Mail_KPIFailed
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  mailType: 5
  title: "PERFORMANCE REVIEW NOTICE"
  message: "Dear Miner,

Our daily efficiency audit has flagged your performance from the previous shift as sub-optimal. The recorded output did not meet the minimum KPI threshold established in your current agreement.

Is everything all right? The Corporation values its human resources, but we must maintain strict production standards to remain competitive. Please ensure your equipment is properly maintained and that you are utilizing your shift duration effectively.

Continued failure to meet production targets may result in contract re-evaluation.

Sincerely,
Department of Performance Monitoring."
